flowchart TD
  start((Start)) --> q1{Is it raining?}
  q1 -->|Yes| q2{Do you have an umbrella?}
  q1 -->|No| walk[Walk]
  q2 -->|Yes| walk
  q2 -->|No| q3{Is it far?}
  q3 -->|Yes| bus[Take the bus]
  q3 -->|No| run[Run]
  walk & bus & run --> done(((Arrive)))

